# Delegate two review perspectives to hands and merge their findings.

agic:
  recall = none
  tools = none
  hands = agic:review_correctness, agic:review_maintainability

  Review this code or diff. Call both hands with the complete input, wait for
  both results, and merge them into one short, prioritized review with no
  duplicate findings. Mark assumptions explicitly and close with the checks
  worth running. Do not claim that any test was run.

  {{_}}

agic review_correctness:
  recall = none
  tools = none

  Review this code or diff for incorrect behavior, missed edge cases, and
  missing error handling. Return only actionable findings supported by the
  supplied text, or state that no concrete issue was found.

  {{_}}

agic review_maintainability:
  recall = none
  tools = none

  Review this code or diff for unclear ownership, unnecessary complexity, and
  fragile coupling. Return only actionable findings supported by the supplied
  text, or state that no concrete issue was found.

  {{_}}
